        Text(877, 203, "There she met a friendly human.\nHe could make sticks fly where he pointed them.\nHe spoke in strange clicks  sounds.\n\nHe could help her catch her favourite meal,\nJuicy Zebra steaks, if they worked together, they could share.\n\nSo together,  they caught a zebra and shared its tasty steaks.\nThe kind human  then painted the creature and called him a friend, so he would always know by his markings of paint,\nThat as a team, working together, even the smallest, can beat the largest of creatures.", Font("Baloo 2", 26));
